.claude/plans/2026-10-02-streak-vacation-clean.md:1:# Streak, vacation mode, and the repeat Clean badge
.claude/plans/2026-10-02-streak-vacation-clean.md:13:1. A streak that rewards showing up: +1 for every day that had blocked time or a kept daily limit; only scheduled days can break it; misses are forgiven by weekly passes or a 30-minute Quick Start rescue; hidden at 0.
.claude/plans/2026-10-02-streak-vacation-clean.md:14:2. Vacation mode: the user picks a return day up to 14 days out; scheduled blocks stop shielding and recording until then; nothing counts against the streak.
.claude/plans/2026-10-02-streak-vacation-clean.md:21:- Home shows a small non-interactive streak indicator top-left only when the streak is 1 or more.
.claude/plans/2026-10-02-streak-vacation-clean.md:30:- U5. A day counts toward the streak when it had any effective blocked time, OR at least one daily limit was on that day and none was skipped or unlocked that day ("stayed within their limit"). This applies on scheduled days too, so a kept limit also protects a scheduled day.
.claude/plans/2026-10-02-streak-vacation-clean.md:32:- U7. Rescue: a missed scheduled day with no pass left is "at risk". One Quick Start with at least 30 minutes of effective blocked time, started after the missed day ended and before the start of day D+3 (local calendar; "within 48 hours"), saves it. One Quick Start saves one missed day. A saved or pass-covered day adds nothing and breaks nothing. A miss while the streak is 0 is never at risk. Saving a streak earns no badge.
.claude/plans/2026-10-02-streak-vacation-clean.md:35:- U10. The Home streak indicator is display-only: tapping it does nothing. No streak sheet.
.claude/plans/2026-10-02-streak-vacation-clean.md:36:- U11. No badge for saving a streak; the Achievements grid stays at 15 with one empty slot in the last row.
.claude/plans/2026-10-02-streak-vacation-clean.md:37:- U12. The four Active Days badges are renamed "<n> Days Total" so they don't read like streak numbers.
.claude/plans/2026-10-02-streak-vacation-clean.md:39:- U14. Streak tracking starts on the first day the new code runs; earlier history is not back-filled.
.claude/plans/2026-10-02-streak-vacation-clean.md:40:- U15. The streak-at-risk notification fires at the next 9:00 AM before the rescue deadline.
.claude/plans/2026-10-02-streak-vacation-clean.md:47:- Streak: none. Legacy keys `currentStreak`, `longestStreak`, `lastSuccessfulDate` exist only for Delete All Data (`SharedConstants.swift:131-137`). Leave them alone.
